{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/cjud8f2h","slide":1,"name":"s47","text":"Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) grounds language-model answers in external documents [1]. Legal QA needs correct answers and\nprecise, complete source-page citations [2, 3]. PDFs may lack searchable text; evidence spans different text scales and may require exact\nlegal terms. Retrieving more passages can also introduce irrelevant pages.","textPreview":"Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) grounds language-model answers in external documents [1]. Legal QA needs correct answers and | preci...","textChars":342,"textLines":3,"bbox":[68.03,252.81,2111.97,118.5]}
