{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ahgr2hsj","slide":1,"name":"s111","text":"Legal RAG should be designed as a multi-stage pipeline: OCR improves robustness to unreadable PDFs, hybrid retrieval and reranking\nimprove answer quality, and post-answer citation selection improves citation precision. However, citation selection introduces a precision–\nrecall trade-off, so answer quality and citation quality should be optimized and evaluated separately.","textPreview":"Legal RAG should be designed as a multi-stage pipeline: OCR improves robustness to unreadable PDFs, hybrid retrieval and reranking | impr...","textChars":373,"textLines":3,"bbox":[86.92,2835.64,2074.19,118.5]}
